{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09706","headline":"送宇文南金放後归太原寓居因呈太原郝主簿 · 岑参","name":"送宇文南金放後归太原寓居因呈太原郝主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归去不得意，北京关路赊。\n却投晋山老，愁见汾阳花。\n翻作灞陵客，怜君丞相家。\n夜眠旅舍雨，晓辞春城鸦。\n送君系马青门口，胡姬垆头劝君酒。\n爲问太原贤主人，春来更有新诗否。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}